{"availability":"available","full":"flyfish-dev/dwf-viewer","name":"dwf-viewer","description":"World's first open-source pure frontend DWF/DWFx preview component: browser-native WebGL/WASM viewer for DWF, DWFx/XPS, W2D, W3D/HSF; English by default with Chinese switch.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":15,"forks":4,"created":"2026-06-11T15:13:36Z","updated":"2026-09-08T02:40:53Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://dwf-viewer-demo.pages.dev/","topics":["cad","cad-viewer","dwf","dwfx","threejs","typescript","viewer","wasm","webgl","xps","xps-webgl"],"demo":"https://dwf-viewer-demo.pages.dev/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:19.605Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:19.605Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:19.605Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T14:47:19.605Z","stars":15,"forks":4}],"technologies":["Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The world's first open-source pure frontend DWF/DWFx preview component for the web. It parses DWF/DWFx packages locally and renders common 2D and 3D CAD content in the browser without a server-side CAD conversion service.","English is the default language for the README, npm package, and online demo. The demo UI can switch to Chinese from the language selector.","DWF and DWFx are still common in manufacturing, construction, field service, engineering archives, PLM, after-sales systems, and document management products. Many web systems can preview PDF, Office files, and images, but DWF often falls back to desktop viewers, server-side conversion, or static thumbnails."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/flyfish-dev/dwf-viewer/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"06ced01a4244b14664a0c5e0221465f3d56c3c6b92a207ee2eaf5c88b74b341d","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:19.703Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:19.703Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The world's first open-source pure frontend DWF/DWFx prev